        "filing_date": "2026-03-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we can participate directly in the NGS and array markets for genetic disease and cancer applications independent of OGM using a monetization model with a pay-per-sample VIA software offering.",
